		<RichText x="899" y="62" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#9a8456" width="207" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#9a8456">制图@Csxylic米游社</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="223" width="414" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">斯瓦罗德唤出6枚光球，依次向玩家投射，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">30%,15%,6%,3%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="60" y="497" fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W04" fontSize="40" fontStyle="italic" fontWeight="normal" color="#e3d2c4" width="434" height="43" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W04" fontSize="40" fontStyle="italic" color="#e3d2c4">光塑的巨人·斯瓦罗德</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#eeeeee" distance="10" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="57" y="545" fontFamily="SDK_SC_Web" fontSize="20" fontStyle="italic" fontWeight="normal" color="#e3d2c4" width="268" height="25" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="SDK_SC_Web" fontSize="20" fontStyle="italic" color="#e3d2c4">Svarod, Velikan of Light</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#eeeeee" distance="10" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="223" width="424" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">斯瓦罗德施放多道源光隙流，接触造成<span color="#b8b8b8">50%,25%,10%,5%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="429" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">斯瓦罗德在自身两侧召唤巨量的，括弧排列状的30枚弹幕，随后飞速袭来，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">20%,10%,4%,2%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="735" width="423" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">斯瓦罗德拟出巨量的，双翼状排列的繁星，对玩家进行轰击，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">20%,10%,<br/>4%,2%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="991" width="423" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">低于<span color="#ffdfbf">50%生命值</span><span>时，斯瓦罗德将准备打开庭院的「门扉」。</span><span color="#ffdfbf">125s</span><span>后蓄力成功，施放时将</span><span color="#ffbfbf">秒杀</span><span>前台。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="479" width="439" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">斯瓦罗德唤出5枚金色光球，<span color="#ffdfbf">可被攻击击破</span><span>，5s后光球变蓝，并缓慢飞来，造成</span><span color="#b8b8b8">40%,20%,8%,4%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="735" width="443" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">斯瓦罗德在胸口处凝聚金光，8s后发射脉冲，造成<span color="#b8b8b8">100%</span><span>伤害。金光可被</span><span color="#ffdfbf">20次攻击</span><span>中断。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
